<title>UK: London silver fixes at fresh 27-month low.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes at fresh 27-month low.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 447.35 cents vs 454.75 cents on Friday. Fresh 27-month low. Fell with gold early on long liquidation. Likely to remain weak under gold's influence.</p>
<p>GOLD - Gold weaker at $315.25/$315.75 vs $324.25/$324.75 Friday close. Very bearish and lower prices forecast.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Weaker with gold at $413.00/$417.00, down $6.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $10.00 at $180.00/$184.00.</p>
</text>
